{"id":"660644","name":"凉拌兔","author":"莉莉呀Lilly","authorId":"12967468","desc":"","cover":"images/660644/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"兔子","amount":"半只"}],"sub":[{"name":"芝麻","amount":"1勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备半只去皮去内脏兔子，清水洗干净。","img":"images/660644/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"冷水下锅。","img":"images/660644/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"撒上姜片和胡椒粉，大火煮。","img":"images/660644/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"姜蒜擦成沫，倒入一勺盐一勺糖一勺醋，一勺酱油，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/660644/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"青椒切碎备用。","img":"images/660644/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"兔肉煮30分钟，家里有老人孩子的尽量煮软烂。","img":"images/660644/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放冷后切块。","img":"images/660644/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"热锅烧油。","img":"images/660644/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"混合青椒碎浇汁搅拌。","img":"images/660644/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"切块的兔肉装盘。","img":"images/660644/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"淋上酱汁，撒上芝麻。","img":"images/660644/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"上桌开吃，酸辣爽口。","img":"images/660644/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}